-- Zip A Folder With PowerShell For Staging In Temp - PowerShell | T1074.001 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/powershell/powershell_classic/posh_pc_susp_zip_compress.yml | NOTA: fallback QRadarAQL_payload_pipeline: campos sem propriedade DSM mapeada são buscados em UTF8(payload) – custo maior, crie custom properties
SELECT * FROM events WHERE devicetype=12 AND (LOWER(UTF8(payload)) LIKE '%compress-archive -path%-destinationpath $env:temp%' OR LOWER(UTF8(payload)) LIKE '%compress-archive -path%-destinationpath%\appdata\local\temp\%' OR LOWER(UTF8(payload)) LIKE '%compress-archive -path%-destinationpath%:\windows\temp\%')
